{"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.099831497728577356,"x":0.13157266582392807,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.11339787801106771,"h":0.015453283581773003,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"parliament, called Tynwald. It's claimed that this is the world's oldest parliament that's still","x":0.13572001637651007,"w":0.66065846761067704,"y":0.14050139218325497,"h":0.015478403745186275},{"t":"functioning, and that it dates back to 979. However, the earliest surviving reference to it is","x":0.13369694922899289,"w":0.66471262613932292,"h":0.015076259842188522,"c":1,"y":0.15522690682048168},{"t":"from 1422, so perhaps it isn't quite as old as it claims!","y":0.17137809203865118,"w":0.40123456319173179,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.13374485823692206,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.19166925971650428,"h":0.014441910845932826,"x":0.1357488255638655,"w":0.65442571004231775,"t":"Day three we have a trip to the mountain Snaefell. This begins with a leisurely ride along"},{"w":0.65843622843424476,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.13374484878063839,"y":0.20639534871484622,"t":"the promenade in Douglas in a horse-drawn tram. Then you board an electric train which"},{"h":0.016862100931443913,"t":"takes you to the fishing village of Laxey. From there it's an eight-kilometre ride in the Snaefell","x":0.13366324008409322,"y":0.2194463945416627,"w":0.69154373168945305,"c":1},{"x":0.13575539718643559,"w":0.66470703124999997,"t":"Mountain Railway to the top. Lunch will be in the café, giving you spectacular views of the","h":0.015537051907416943,"y":0.2353843987051516,"c":1},{"y":0.251453488096129,"x":0.13374485538601597,"c":1,"t":"island.","h":0.014534883982160629,"w":0.053497943878173831},{"y":0.27100770981070132,"h":0.016164802690557645,"c":1,"t":"Day four is free for you to explore, using the pass which we'll give you. So you won't have to","x":0.13574483053701802,"w":0.6832623799641927},{"w":0.66885869344075521,"c":1,"t":"pay for travel on local transport, or for entrance to the island's heritage sites. Or you might","y":0.28538175882806383,"h":0.014716471884360205,"x":0.13572485146577548},{"t":"just want to take it easy in Douglas and perhaps do a little light shopping.","w":0.54526748657226565,"x":0.13374485755180307,"y":0.30087209289709593,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"y":0.3215966302318225,"w":0.64008850097656245,"h":0.016380129208693917,"x":0.1336640105554045,"t":"The last full day, day five, is for some people the highlight of the holiday, with a ride on","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.1337448559481576,"t":"the steam railway, from Douglas to Port Erin. After some time to explore, a coach will take","y":0.33716136629607152,"w":0.66666666666666674,"h":0.01472320376914027},{"c":1,"w":0.66255142211914064,"h":0.01309680320910489,"y":0.35174418592501766,"t":"you to the headland that overlooks the Calf of Man, a small island just off the coast. From","x":0.13580247821605071},{"h":0.015699134979427765,"t":"there you continue to Castletown, which used to be the capital of the Isle of Man, and its","x":0.13572751301521152,"y":0.36468968733558538,"c":1,"w":0.65447835286458322},{"c":1,"t":"mediaeval castle.","y":0.38084029924384455,"w":0.13416431427001951,"x":0.13562637232577718,"h":0.013179884642116835},{"h":0.01628169069863028,"t":"And on day six it's back to the ferry - or the airport, if you flew to the island - and time to go","x":0.13573593539880827,"y":0.40070865278668255,"w":0.679151102701823,"c":1},{"x":0.13526710017623003,"c":1,"h":0.010618882690357712,"w":0.052382968266805024,"y":0.41910633570009503,"t":"home."},{"w":0.18354340871175132,"y":0.43845468145932887,"h":0.014124774820532204,"t":"Now I'd like to tell you...","c":1,"x":0.13561012302746386},{"h":0.014760948603509849,"x":0.1357686761521166,"y":0.4926195256744681,"w":0.096775404612223337,"t":"PART 3","c":1},{"w":0.041220779418945308,"h":0.0088836453126652781,"t":"RUTH:","y":0.52172096801877799,"x":0.13576821101592626,"c":1},{"y":0.53633720918431582,"w":0.024691357612609849,"t":"ED:","x":0.13580246924831538,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"t":"RUTH:","x":0.13580246858700926,"y":0.55087209292193684,"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.041152264277140277},{"y":0.5639534881110887,"w":0.024691357612609877,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"x":0.13580246947901742,"t":"ED:"},{"x":0.13580247058257428,"w":0.041152261098225923,"c":1,"t":"RUTH:","h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.62209302303720315},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"ED:","x":0.13374485565597097,"y":0.65116279047690317,"w":0.026748971939086902,"c":1},{"w":0.043444258371988925,"x":0.13362766456106864,"t":"RUTH:","h":0.010682460978118202,"c":1,"y":0.69451342055233078},{"t":"ED:","y":0.73837209288943162,"w":0.028806584676106778,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"x":0.13374485570721409},{"w":0.043349622090657569,"c":1,"t":"RUTH:","y":0.78182669481614986,"x":0.13573259625441378,"h":0.010474517292072161},{"x":0.13374485591297541,"t":"ED:","y":0.82412790672690317,"w":0.028806584676106778,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.88226744163969384,"x":0.13580246908551249,"t":"RUTH:","w":0.043209877014160153,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.91715116260773688,"w":0.024691357612609849,"t":"98","x":0.13580246923896255,"c":1},{"t":"Ed, how are you getting on with the reading for our presentation next week?","x":0.22626238803387555,"w":0.56399230957031254,"h":0.016351445965267053,"c":1,"y":0.51720971810251426},{"t":"Well, OK, Ruth - but there's so much of it.","x":0.22416301995098792,"h":0.016301062980445202,"y":0.53211477960690212,"w":0.31507336934407554,"c":1},{"x":0.22622675467693434,"t":"I know, I hadn't realised birth order was such a popular area of research.","y":0.5460037404897945,"h":0.015987555747599469,"c":1,"w":0.53928466796875008},{"t":"But the stuff on birth order and personality is mostly unreliable. From what I've","y":0.56096405589572629,"x":0.22627612402557512,"w":0.58036738077799477,"h":0.014344363667518456,"c":1},{"x":0.22627231368386391,"w":0.59890065511067703,"h":0.014542040471053452,"c":1,"y":0.57592474675085037,"t":"been reading a lot of the claims about how your position in the family determines"},{"t":"certain personality traits are just stereotypes, with no robust evidence to support","x":0.22427984568730958,"h":0.015988372380376759,"y":0.59156976729441291,"w":0.59876541137695316,"c":1},{"t":"them.","h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.60755813935771708,"c":1,"x":0.22427983529139386,"w":0.047325102488199849},{"x":0.22626681459553538,"c":1,"w":0.57010253906250008,"t":"OK, but that's an interesting point - we could start by outlining what previous","h":0.016846560196264293,"y":0.61895429797315815},{"w":0.54732508341471353,"x":0.22633745823113846,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.63515901087183901,"c":1,"t":"research has shown. There are studies going back over a hundred years."},{"t":"Yeah - so we could just run through some of the typical traits. Like the","x":0.22222222669344055,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.52674896240234381,"c":1,"y":0.64811542992225823},{"h":0.017352682120387208,"c":1,"y":0.66194758479295412,"t":"consensus seems to be that oldest children are generally less well-adjusted","x":0.22417802673889262,"w":0.5660751851399739},{"h":0.014902397375926912,"y":0.67712836687855504,"x":0.22626392677953086,"w":0.44870651245117188,"c":1,"t":"because they never get over the arrival of a younger sibling."},{"h":0.017908454643402294,"x":0.22623767580761134,"c":1,"w":0.57221537272135414,"t":"Right, but on a positive note, some studies claimed that they were thought to","y":0.69086518825729992},{"x":0.22421180473913485,"y":0.70580860408726886,"t":"be good at nurturing - certainly in the past when people had large families they","w":0.59477610270182291,"c":1,"h":0.015626520936424471},{"x":0.22415671757595704,"y":0.72005200419563298,"c":1,"w":0.43641387939453125,"h":0.016259045145958217,"t":"would have been expected to look after the younger ones."},{"w":0.5701734415690104,"y":0.73395643413241929,"x":0.22624256370261775,"c":1,"h":0.015960660783927216,"t":"There isn't such a clear picture for middle children - but one trait that a lot of"},{"x":0.22633745264123983,"t":"the studies mention is that they are easier to get on with than older or younger","w":0.58436213175455731,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.74999999987780741},{"t":"siblings.","h":0.013486009604518068,"y":0.76574804989162348,"c":1,"w":0.066906064351399758,"x":0.22586637367068055},{"t":"Generally eager to please and helpful - although that's certainly not accurate as","w":0.59670781453450528,"y":0.77906976730673128,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.22633745073571238},{"x":0.22626871481190164,"c":1,"w":0.5742101033528646,"t":"far as my family goes - my middle brother was a nightmare - always causing","y":0.79149241600564779,"h":0.015635037731085322},{"x":0.22418082593571456,"y":0.80793218011743306,"h":0.014857313517827708,"w":0.28003237406412762,"c":1,"t":"fights and envious of whatever I had."},{"c":1,"t":"As I said - none of this seems to relate to my own experience. I'm the youngest","w":0.59465021769205739,"x":0.22633744354880453,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.82122093007866714},{"y":0.83274944268276763,"t":"in my family and I don't recognise myself in any of the studies I've read about. I'm","w":0.60731948852539064,"h":0.019685167867528053,"c":1,"x":0.2261955873522199},{"t":"supposed to have been a sociable and confident child who made friends easily -","x":0.22624069769525401,"h":0.016048813877173052,"w":0.60305196126302085,"y":0.8494807820397674,"c":1},{"y":0.86627906951570255,"c":1,"x":0.22633745368985567,"w":0.22222221374511722,"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"but I was actually terribly shy."},{"c":1,"w":0.58863545735677081,"h":0.015780637626513161,"y":0.87864069107845744,"x":0.22625774122447354,"t":"Really? That's funny. There have been hundreds of studies on twins but mostly"},{"w":0.2304526774088542,"y":0.89680232548482619,"t":"about nurture versus nature ...","x":0.22839506035821586,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512463},{"y":0.1686046509725625,"x":0.86008230498302851,"t":"Q16","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378},{"c":1,"t":"Q17","x":0.86008230492087134,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.23401162776614726},{"t":"Q18","y":0.2703488370684729,"x":0.86008230492087134,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1},{"x":0.86213991808316581,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"y":0.33575581381023645,"t":"Q19","w":0.034979422887166378},{"c":1,"x":0.86213991808959578,"y":0.36482558125451936,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q20","h":0.011627907185728592},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.034979422887166267,"y":0.6904069765857529,"t":"Q21","c":1,"x":0.86419753125832022},{"x":0.8641975312656075,"y":0.77761627890860907,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q22"},{"h":0.013405002328897297,"x":0.86613496894927566,"t":"Q23","w":0.035219774246215807,"c":1,"y":0.84867540568244793}],"h":3395}